a dirty `artifacts/**` as a pre-flight failure; or compare them perceptually rather than by byte. **All three are policy choices with a cost, so this is a RULING, not a mechanical fix.** **GATE: closes when a ruling picks one of the three for tracked screenshot evidence AND the pre-flight clean-vs-main test is reconciled with it.** ⓘ Scope note, stated so nobody over-reads this: measured for `wire-crawler-3d` + `wire-railcar-3d`, `desktop-chrome`, this machine. Other specs that write screenshots are **unmeasured** and are likely the same class.
