orms are ACCEPTED, not that any can EXECUTE. **F-ER02-15: "7/7 grammar forms" measures the validator; this rehearsal is the first thing to measure the executor.** Re-running that probe without the god-hero rig is a separate, fire-authorable slice and does not need this ruling.
